flowchart TD
 A([User opens app\nfor first time]) --> B[OB-01\nWelcome Screen\nCervais brand intro]
 B --> C[Tap Get Started]
 C --> D[OB-02\nHardware Pairing\nScan QR code on Guardian]
 D --> E[ Camera activates\nQR scanner overlay appears]
 E --> F[User scans QR on\nGuardian device]
 F --> G[ App sends pairing\nrequest to Guardian]
 G --> H[OB-03\nConnecting...\nLoading animation]
 H --> I[ OB-04\nPairing Success\nGuardian name + device ID confirmed]
 I --> J[Tap Continue]
 J --> K[OB-06\nAccount Setup\nEnter email + password]
 K --> L[ Account created\nDID auto-generated]
 L --> M[OB-07\nDID Introduction\nPlain language explainer\nDID displayed + copy button]
 M --> N[Tap Copy DID\nthen Continue]
 N --> O[OB-08\nCreate First Circle\nEnter circle name + description]
 O --> P[Tap Create Circle]
 P --> Q[ Certificate Authority\ngenerated\nCircle network initialized]
 Q --> R[OB-09\nAll Set!\nSummary screen]
 R --> S[Tap Go to Dashboard]
 S --> T([HM-01\nHome Dashboard\n Guardian connected])
